<title>HONG KONG: Pokfulam Dev year net rises 39.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Pokfulam Dev year net rises 39.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   49.5   vs 35.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.0   vs 12.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 14.19 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    54.49  vs 38.98</p>
<p>    Turnover		     116.45 vs 115.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pokfulam Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 19-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Pokfulam Development is a property developer, investor and manager.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 18 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs 15 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
